# 卫生宏：define-syntax 定义 swap!，引入的临时变量不捕获用户绑定
wait 2.5
type (define-syntax swap! (syntax-rules () ((_ x y) (let ((t x)) (set! x y) (set! y t)))))
key enter
wait 0.8
type (define x 1)
key enter
wait 0.5
type (define y 2)
key enter
wait 0.5
type (swap! x y)
key enter
wait 0.8
type (list x y)
key enter
wait 1.2
type (exit)
key enter
